msgid "⟪k:0⟫The first its parents embraced—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫and the second they wholly rejected."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫I suoi genitori accolsero la prima—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫e rifiutarono completamente⟪k:3⟫la seconda."

