#: scenario7:scenario7_7F42135A_D9EB_36B7_373C_FCBAB27DCB5A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3db6f4fc155d1afd01572eb9a4e02b064ce901542582bcc41da8f62badd72098
