msgid "⟪k:0⟫not even the child itself."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫nemmeno l’infante stessa."

#: scenario7:scenario7_D963F74B_3365_4AEA_9DF9_E5223184BAEC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 46eb7738a2ab999cc3a77866531f4563e668138fd64163478c3e48043db349ac
