msgid "⟪k:0⟫before her child finally realized the truth."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫prima che la neonata si rendesse finalmente conto della verità."

#: scenario7:scenario7_9A031404_A212_485A_951E_7A1AA5D74456
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1217ca835845eb8d2d0fcddfdaa36dbee8654e583cd02b250be7c3e16baec3c1
#. default-sha256: 96f0bfcbc8985d62d7f98877422f01a1015d6a5be952993b85226acedecc633b
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_9A031404_A212_485A_951E_7A1AA5D74456"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Blind to the fact that the moment it had let out its first cry,⟪k:1⟫everything came crashing "
"down."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Cieca al fatto che, nel momento in cui aveva emesso il suo primo vagito, tutto aveva "
"iniziato a crollare."

#: scenario7:scenario7_01104E12_C871_4BD4_A7BA_36E16748DA01
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 19faa8274ffa972d8490b918e50620ae45682c15a097d6ecf395237f50503028
#. default-sha256: ddd19af8cac0a4da04289c23f1ae1dc0c040fd58ef1d7130fa65be62f84ed324
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_01104E12_C871_4BD4_A7BA_36E16748DA01"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫To this day, she still doesn’t ⟪k:1⟫know⟪k:2⟫ the child she gave birth to..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Ad oggi, lei ⟪k:1⟫non conosce⟪k:2⟫ ancora la bambina a cui ha dato la luce..."

#: scenario7:scenario7_E2145377_DA66_4D2D_BD1F_344ABAC574D6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c97a6a8805388814e16fbdd289474984fb713a8c9b8006e4014b0c0e0da6fc93
#. default-sha256: 8e4568d730872bfd43959600ee9ef2dfe6429f3788da019ad7b32af080b8fba5
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_E2145377_DA66_4D2D_BD1F_344ABAC574D6"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫That she set loose a curse upon the world—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫a curse that turned angels into demons, "
"humans into witches."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Non sa di aver rilasciato una maledizione sul mondo—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫una maledizione che aveva "
"trasformato angeli in demoni,⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫e uomini in streghe."

#: scenario7:scenario7_5D454F0D_ABB4_4F08_A58E_2B1384E97A17
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
