msgid "⟪k:0⟫Hehe, she’s beautiful, isn’t she?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Have you seen her laugh?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Hehe, è bellissima, vero?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫L’hai vista mentre ride?"

#: scenario7:scenario7_EB215257_53C5_4C4C_B147_5C722FC7FF77
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
