msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Not yet, I haven’t.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫At any rate... ⟪k:3⟫that color certainly is something else..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫No, non ancora.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Ad ogni modo... ⟪k:3⟫quel colore è davvero incredibile..."

#: scenario7:scenario7_05CAE79F_BC9E_45D4_B455_6D79A02884C7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 95228be06a2b4cb32eb9aa8677fcf929ee4258971f13e61425aee0640f01e6b5
