#: scenario7:scenario7_D20CBA4A_60EF_4509_A3E0_F5DE489EB604
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f437ce328bd34cd15ffc7b8286ca0a3827d9b4ed3a2806a30e39a268c0fdc6f1
